<title>UK: Lehman Brothers set warrants on Porsche.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers set warrants on Porsche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Porsche, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE    ISS PRICE  PREMIUM    GEARING     MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    2,500.00  2.78 DEM   34.53 PCT  7.42 TIMES  30.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL B    2,500.00  5.40 DEM   47.22 PCT  3.82 TIMES  30.SEP.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE  24.MAR.97    LISTING  FFT STG DDF    MIN EXER LOT  100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2,065.00 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
